Items with this [[Item Tags|tag]] cannot be rerolled in most circumstances, and bypass character-specific limitations. Most items in this list are progression-related.

* {{c|Tainted Isaac}}: Items do not have a second option, and do not contribute to the 8-item limit.
* {{c|Tainted Cain}}: Items will not be decomposed into pickups, and can be picked up as normal.
* {{c|Tainted Eden}}: Items will not be rerolled upon hit.

